@startuml Unified Contract Flow After Sprint 6
!theme plain
title <font size=24 color="#1565C0"><b>UNIFIED: Frontend + Webhook Flow After Sprint 6</b></font>\n<font size=14 color="#1976D2">Both paths now use the contract state machine!</font>

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000

left to right direction

rectangle "Frontend Flow\n<font color='#2E7D32'>(Contract-Aware)</font>" as Frontend #C8E6C9 {
    rectangle "1. StripeContractCreationHandler" as F1 #A5D6A7
    rectangle "2. StripeCheckoutSessionHandler" as F2 #A5D6A7
    rectangle "3. StripeCheckoutReturnHandler" as F3 #A5D6A7
    rectangle "4. PaymentAuthorizedEventHandler" as F4 #A5D6A7
    rectangle "5. StripeOrderCreationHandler" as F5 #A5D6A7

    F1 --> F2
    F2 --> F3
    F3 --> F4
    F4 --> F5
}

rectangle "Contract State Machine" as Contract #FFF9C4 {
    rectangle "DRAFT" as Draft #2196F3
    rectangle "PENDING" as Pending #FF9800
    rectangle "READY_TO_COMMIT" as Ready #4CAF50
    rectangle "COMMITTED" as Committed #8BC34A
    rectangle "FULFILLED" as Fulfilled #009688

    Draft --> Pending : transitionToPending()
    Pending --> Ready : fulfillCondition()
    Ready --> Committed : commitToOrder()
    Committed --> Fulfilled : <font color='#2E7D32'><b>fulfill()</b></font>\n<font color='#2E7D32'>(Sprint 6 FIX!)</font>
}

rectangle "Webhook Flow\n<font color='#2E7D32'>(NOW Contract-Aware!)</font>" as Webhook #C8E6C9 {
    rectangle "WebhookController" as W1 #A5D6A7
    rectangle "WebhookProcessingService" as W2 #A5D6A7
    rectangle "WebhookContractFulfillmentHandler" as W3 #81C784

    W1 --> W2
    W2 --> W3
}

rectangle "Events Dispatched" as Events #E1BEE7 {
    rectangle "ContractCreatedEvent" as E1 #CE93D8
    rectangle "PaymentAuthorizedEvent" as E2 #CE93D8
    rectangle "ContractCommittedEvent" as E3 #CE93D8
    rectangle "ContractFulfilledEvent" as E4 #CE93D8
}

' Connections from Frontend to Contract
F1 ..> Draft : Creates
F4 ..> Pending : Transitions
F4 ..> Ready : When authorized
F5 ..> Committed : After order

' Connection from Webhook (NOW WORKS!)
W3 ..> Committed : Finds via\nproviderOrderId
W3 ..> Fulfilled : <font color='#2E7D32'><b>Transitions!</b></font>

' Event connections
F1 ..> E1 : dispatches
F4 ..> E2 : dispatches
F5 ..> E3 : dispatches
W3 ..> E4 : <font color='#2E7D32'><b>dispatches!</b></font>

note right of Frontend
  <font color='#2E7D32'><b>Uses:</b></font>
  - ContractRepository
  - EventDispatcher
  - Contract state machine
  - PaymentContract model

  <b>State Transitions:</b>
  DRAFT → PENDING → READY → COMMITTED
end note

note right of Webhook
  <font color='#2E7D32'><b>NOW USES (Sprint 6):</b></font>
  - ContractRepository
  - EventDispatcher
  - Contract state machine
  - PaymentContract model

  <b>State Transition:</b>
  COMMITTED → FULFILLED

  <font color='#2E7D32'><b>Via new handler:</b></font>
  WebhookContractFulfillmentHandler
end note

note bottom of Contract
  <font color='#2E7D32'><b>SPRINT 6 UNIFIED!</b></font>
  Frontend creates contract: DRAFT → COMMITTED
  Webhook completes lifecycle: COMMITTED → FULFILLED

  Both flows now use the contract layer!
  State machine integrity preserved.
end note

legend bottom
  |= Flow |= Uses Contract? |= State Transitions |= Events |
  | <#C8E6C9> Frontend | YES | DRAFT→PENDING→READY→COMMITTED | Created, Authorized, Committed |
  | <#C8E6C9> Webhook | <font color='#2E7D32'><b>YES (Sprint 6)</b></font> | COMMITTED→FULFILLED | <font color='#2E7D32'><b>Fulfilled</b></font> |

  <font color='#2E7D32'><b>THE "TWO PATHS" AMBIGUITY IS RESOLVED!</b></font>
  Contract completes full lifecycle: DRAFT → PENDING → READY → COMMITTED → FULFILLED
endlegend

@enduml
